    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy presents an exciting new boutique development a private enclave of just four luxury detached, A1-rated new homes, designed to offer unparalleled quality and modern living in a highly desirable village setting. These bespoke residences represent the pinnacle of contemporary design, combining spacious, light-filled layouts (ranging from 142 sq.m to 175 sq.m) with the highest standards of energy efficiency and construction.\n\nKey Features \nA1 BER Rating: Engineered for the highest energy performance, ensuring exceptional comfort and minimal running costs. \nContemporary Design: Sleek, modern architecture with high-spec finishes throughout, setting a new standard for quality in Ballyboughal.\nSpacious Layouts: Generously proportioned interiors optimized for family life.\nPrivate Gardens: Each home includes private front and rear gardens, offering essential outdoor space and parking.\n\nBallyboughal itself is a charming location that offers a wonderful blend of rural tranquillity and strong community spirit, all while maintaining excellent connectivity.\nYou'll enjoy an exclusive location with local amenities right on your doorstep. For families, the convenient proximity to excellent schools, local shops, and leisure facilities is unmatched.\n\nDespite the tranquil setting, commuting is straightforward with easy access to the M1 and M50 motorways, Dublin Airport is just a short drive away. This is a unique opportunity to secure a high-specification, future-proofed home in a beautiful and thriving North County Dublin village.\n\nThe Ballyboughal Lifestyle & Connectivity\nEnjoy the unique advantage of an exclusive new home in a mature, thriving community. Ballyboughal offers a wonderful blend of rural tranquillity and strong community spirit, providing the perfect sanctuary from city life. The village offers a range of amenities & leisure facilities on your doorstep:\nLocal Attractions: Residents enjoy scenic hiking trails in the nearby Naul Hills and can take advantage of the village's riverside park and garden.\nLeisure Facilities: The area offers golf courses, a pitch and putt area, GAA club, easy access to a nearby leisure centre with a swimming pool and much more.\nCultural Hub: The village hosts local festivals showcasing traditional Irish arts, and the Séamus Ennis Arts Centre is nearby, dedicated to preserving Irish traditional music and art.\nConvenience: Local amenities, including excellent schools and shops, petrol station are right within the village\nBallyboughal boasts good access to the M1 and M50 motorways and is approximately 14km from Dublin Airport. The village is also served by local bus routes.\n\nWith only three homes available, this is a unique chance to secure a high-specification, energy-efficient family home in one of North County Dublin's most sought-after and charming villages. Whether you're upsizing, relocating, or seeking a future-proofed investment, these homes represent a lifestyle upgrade with lasting value."
      },
